{"author":[{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/18a6db2775f36a6a1b0cae6a88e8df282b27cf4a9db808be9c693fd35bdd3314798a1545d32d424a38e33f75b203165168f010c199ce63799b5e91d6309969a3","height":1907,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/m-PDSndGA4cUhtNjSl4HXPqXIaHxvYG28BPPcal5dnXUge1Po6SJJw2I3RjrIYyKBY6exL4bXnjaDt9dusnuDVO_anSC8lzVK7pCvWo","width":1907},"name":"Nick Rout","title":"Material Developer Advocate"},"document_id":4524200575107072,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"}],"body_content":[{"code_snippet":[],"content":"<p>我们很高兴地宣布一个全新的权威参考问世：Compose Material Catalog，它涵盖 Material Design 组件、主题化、深色主题，以及如何在 Jetpack Compose 中实现这些功能。</p>\n<p>如果你想进一步了解 Compose 的 Material Design 特性，请查阅我们的<a href=\"https://material.io/blog/jetpack-compose-beta\">博客文章</a>。</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; max-width: 100%; height: 0;\"><iframe style=\"border-radius: 16px; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/G3EPHgEKKcA\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></div>\n<h2>Catalog 的功能</h2>\n<p>该应用由三个主要屏幕组成：主屏幕、组件屏幕和示例屏幕。你随时可以从顶部应用栏打开主题选择器或“更多”菜单。应用也支持深色主题。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=0&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<h4>主屏幕</h4>\n<p>主屏幕以响应式网格展示 Compose 中可用的 Material 组件——从浮动操作按钮（FAB）到导航抽屉。点按某个组件即可进入组件屏幕。</p>\n<h4>组件屏幕</h4>\n<p>组件屏幕包含该 Material 组件的说明，以及用 Compose 实现的相关示例列表。点按某个示例即可进入示例屏幕。</p>\n<h4>示例屏幕</h4>\n<p>示例屏幕包含一个用 Compose 实现的该 Material 组件的交互式示例。</p>\n<h4>主题选择器</h4>\n<p>主题选择器和“更多”菜单可以通过顶部应用栏从任何屏幕访问。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=1&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>主题选择器允许你选择 Material Theming 值——包括颜色、字体排印和形状。这些值会（通过在当前主题与新主题之间播放动画）应用到示例和应用本身，让你看到组件如何响应这些变化。</p>\n<h4>“更多”菜单</h4>\n<p>“更多”菜单包含指向设计指南、开发者文档、源代码和问题跟踪器的链接。这些链接会因你所在的屏幕而异——例如，源代码链接在组件屏幕上显示 composable 的源代码，在示例屏幕上显示示例的源代码。</p>\n<h4>深色主题</h4>\n<p>应用会响应系统的深色主题。你可以看到 Material 深色主题特性的实际效果，例如海拔高度遮罩（elevation overlays）和克制的色彩点缀。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=2&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<h2>与源码同步、始终保持最新</h2>\n<p>该应用与 Compose 库的源代码一同维护，确保你能获得最新的 Compose API 变更。它直接根据 API 参考文档中的代码片段构建，最新的示例会直接出现在 Catalog 中。</p>\n<p>我们来看一个例子：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://cs.android.com/androidx/platform/frameworks/support/+/androidx-main:compose/material/material/samples/src/main/java/androidx/compose/material/samples/ButtonSamples.kt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">存放在 AOSP 中、可编译的 <code>ButtonSample</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://cs.android.com/androidx/platform/frameworks/support/+/androidx-main:compose/material/material/src/commonMain/kotlin/androidx/compose/material/Button.kt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><code>Button</code> 的 KDoc 中对 <code>ButtonSample</code> 的 <code>@sample</code> 标签引用</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/kotlin/androidx/compose/material/package-summary#button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">展示 <code>ButtonSample</code> 代码片段的 <code>Button</code> API 参考文档</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://cs.android.com/androidx/platform/frameworks/support/+/androidx-main:compose/material/material/integration-tests/material-catalog/src/main/java/androidx/compose/material/catalog/library/model/Examples.kt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">将 <code>ButtonSample</code> 用作按钮示例的应用</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>获取 Catalog</h2>\n<p>你可以通过多种形式获取该应用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在 <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=androidx.compose.material.catalog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google Play</a> 上获取该应用</li>\n<li>从 <a href=\"https://github.com/android/compose-samples/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Jetpack Compose 示例 GitHub 仓库的发布页面</a>下载 APK</li>\n<li>使用 <a href=\"https://cs.android.com/androidx/platform/frameworks/support/+/androidx-main:compose/integration-tests/material-catalog/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Android Code Search</a> 或 <a href=\"https://github.com/androidx/androidx/tree/androidx-main/compose/integration-tests/material-catalog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub 上同步的 Android Jetpack 仓库</a>在 AOSP 上查看源代码。如果你已检出代码并在 Android Studio 中打开，也可以直接运行该应用。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>觉得这个 Catalog 有帮助吗？在 <a href=\"https://twitter.com/MaterialDesign\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Twitter</a> 上告诉我们！</p>","image":[{"a11y_description":"Screens in the Compose Material Catalog","bordered":true,"caption":"Screens in the Compose Material Catalog","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/52783f9086e4abe9ff459cf66512aa06e9d9b87a58d450ffa5741dd20cb84c58e969aa2e0f362bf4d5461cff90278edaa05d8f18b0a78b8aed11b92685c78565","height":2332,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/cu90fkIIhQt6dUFBynmoXpBiC_EQDSDmocEd8oFHPtBlWeagHL9m9wbDHUdgD371oR_nrxs3wcik020Vn5bJCXzR7XYr_hnYxCaVGk51XImCg_ftgGg","width":4600}},{"a11y_description":"Theme picker in the Compose Material Catalog","bordered":true,"caption":"Theme picker in the Compose Material Catalog","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/65ba79920beec836e750bc8d1cf28569e011c9e495690ecd17367119265d5daadf9d78a3db5c5c783f7b571ca049f2c6ccb6614c9e9857152467262d739cf9a1","height":2332,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/bgVADi_We_Ncs0GcPReNEgA8K1yKHoytRbMwMZQ0kPATeadb1WZM8LJwRZs-N_SSPq6XlFBO91rN6Tzf_V-4j4T1DILxTmZjIktl_06LCAYU24eWU0E","width":4600}},{"a11y_description":"Dark theme in the Compose Material Catalog","bordered":true,"caption":"Dark theme in the Compose Material Catalog","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/073ed707ec87d164b8397fd54ae38c2d5bf7416bba8f8dac952b3bf0b0474678bdd86a08ef3029ae740b48fd92e33bead4bad6434c99df36e9b8c91429e0c11b","height":2332,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/xyweyVkypn20erzyYn9GN2T-t4sv1SLDi3zBS_3u0x9XD92HZap__ktET11kcA0IzZxuZ3Q8R52nMP7p6Mm1oN15_atYt-eYQHASDEJJln1RQaGM17A","width":4600}}],"related_links":[],"table":[],"video":[]}],